{
  "$comment": "sentry-python sends events to the DSN's ingest host (the DSN is given to `sentry_sdk.init`, which sends nothing by itself). Only the capture functions are calls; scope variants cover the `get_current_scope()` / legacy `Hub.current` forms.",
